  "description": "<p><strong>⭐ </strong><em>A hidden bar. A masked crowd. A crime waiting to be solved. Step inside this secret </em><em>speakeasy</em><em> where every cocktail reveals a new clue and every guest becomes part of the mystery. Get your tickets for </em><strong><em>Murder on the Rocks</em></strong><em> in London!</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🎭 Dive into a murder mystery experience where masked actors move through the space, blurring the line between guest and suspect<br>\r\n🍸 Enjoy three crafted cocktails served throughout the experience, each tied to a moment in the story<br>\r\n🕵️ Follow the unfolding story from up close and gather clues hidden in conversations and interactions<br>\r\n🗳️ Cast your vote at the end of the night and help decide who is responsible for the crime</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: 75 minutes<br>\r\n📍 Location: Glaziers Hall<br>\r\n👤 Age requirement: 18+<br>\r\n🪑 Seating is assigned on a first-come, first-served basis within the selected zone<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility:&nbsp;the venue is wheelchair accessible<br>\r\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vQD5Gs7W5czEeOjO0d1ZuB96X1JoxMpK4hEjfqRtYJ5x-neTXv1izGY2mOV3WOb9fauqiRc0iEy3qVV/pub\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nBehind an unmarked door, a hidden speakeasy comes to life. Masks conceal every guest as cocktails flow and a story unfolds around you. Then it happens: a crime disrupts the night. From that moment, every glance and whisper becomes a clue. Actors move through the room, pulling you into the mystery. As you enjoy each cocktail, you’ll piece together the story and cast your final vote. Watch closely. Trust no one. Get your tickets for Murder on the Rocks in London!</p>",
